    "name": "CatLands",
    "steam_appid": 3581890,
    "required_age": 0,
    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Welcome to <strong>Catlands </strong>\u2014 a cozy world brimming with puzzles and adorable cats!</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Endless Variety to Delight You</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every level is unique, with procedurally generated landscapes and numerous modifiers ensuring you\u2019ll never feel bored. Each challenge is a pleasant task that allows you to create something beautiful and rewarding.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3581890/extras/210f85ae465e9a8eb8f4a77ba3ee593f.poster.avif?t=1754316384\" width=800 height=299 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3581890/extras/210f85ae465e9a8eb8f4a77ba3ee593f.webm?t=1754316384\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Home Built by Your Hands</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Build your own village from the ground up \u2014 create the place you\u2019ve always dreamed of. Customize decorations and design your very own cozy corner of happiness.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3581890/extras/235043bbc75614fc91cb30ddd1db45e0.avif?t=1754316384\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Fluffy Friends Await</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Vibrant feline residents want to settle at your location. Befriend them, take part in their hobbies and uncover their heartwarming stories through a collection of charming comics.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3581890/extras/34fd0b56ae7cd95bb473a0797786960d.poster.avif?t=1754316384\" width=785 height=361 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3581890/extras/34fd0b56ae7cd95bb473a0797786960d.webm?t=1754316384\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Calm and Cozy Atmosphere</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Catlands is a relaxing puzzle game free from rush or pressure in picturesque locations. Watch as fields, forests, rivers, and mills come to life under your fingertips, forming charming landscapes that soothe the soul.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3581890/extras/2ac3ae8c494a655600c60074766f15e0.poster.avif?t=1754316384\" width=800 height=327 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3581890/extras/2ac3ae8c494a655600c60074766f15e0.webm?t=1754316384\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\u2728 <strong>Features</strong>:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Puzzle Landscapes</strong>: Assemble stunning locations and enjoy a meditative, creative process.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Village Building</strong>: Earn rewards by solving puzzles and use them to craft your dream settlement.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Charming Cats</strong>: Populate your village with delightful feline friends. Befriend them, learn their stories, and make your village feel alive!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Personalized Decor</strong>: Customize the village layout and watch your fluffy residents go about their daily lives.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Cozy Atmosphere</strong>: Immerse yourself in a world of peaceful music and serene landscapes, designed to bring comfort and tranquility.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3581890/extras/a66b19cd3ce784c1e9e6bd735763f67f.poster.avif?t=1754316384\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3581890/extras/a66b19cd3ce784c1e9e6bd735763f67f.webm?t=1754316384\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Step into Catlands and let the purr-fect adventure begin! \ud83d\udc3e</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3581890/extras/fcf4c3d8b6e4565c77ae5953d8853110.avif?t=1754316384\" width=800 height=264 /></span></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Welcome to <strong>Catlands </strong>\u2014 a cozy world brimming with puzzles and adorable cats!</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Endless Variety to Delight You</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every level is unique, with procedurally generated landscapes and numerous modifiers ensuring you\u2019ll never feel bored. Each challenge is a pleasant task that allows you to create something beautiful and rewarding.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3581890/extras/210f85ae465e9a8eb8f4a77ba3ee593f.poster.avif?t=1754316384\" width=800 height=299 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3581890/extras/210f85ae465e9a8eb8f4a77ba3ee593f.webm?t=1754316384\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Home Built by Your Hands</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Build your own village from the ground up \u2014 create the place you\u2019ve always dreamed of. Customize decorations and design your very own cozy corner of happiness.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3581890/extras/235043bbc75614fc91cb30ddd1db45e0.avif?t=1754316384\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Fluffy Friends Await</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Vibrant feline residents want to settle at your location. Befriend them, take part in their hobbies and uncover their heartwarming stories through a collection of charming comics.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3581890/extras/34fd0b56ae7cd95bb473a0797786960d.poster.avif?t=1754316384\" width=785 height=361 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3581890/extras/34fd0b56ae7cd95bb473a0797786960d.webm?t=1754316384\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Calm and Cozy Atmosphere</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Catlands is a relaxing puzzle game free from rush or pressure in picturesque locations. Watch as fields, forests, rivers, and mills come to life under your fingertips, forming charming landscapes that soothe the soul.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3581890/extras/2ac3ae8c494a655600c60074766f15e0.poster.avif?t=1754316384\" width=800 height=327 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3581890/extras/2ac3ae8c494a655600c60074766f15e0.webm?t=1754316384\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\u2728 <strong>Features</strong>:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Puzzle Landscapes</strong>: Assemble stunning locations and enjoy a meditative, creative process.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Village Building</strong>: Earn rewards by solving puzzles and use them to craft your dream settlement.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Charming Cats</strong>: Populate your village with delightful feline friends. Befriend them, learn their stories, and make your village feel alive!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Personalized Decor</strong>: Customize the village layout and watch your fluffy residents go about their daily lives.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Cozy Atmosphere</strong>: Immerse yourself in a world of peaceful music and serene landscapes, designed to bring comfort and tranquility.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3581890/extras/a66b19cd3ce784c1e9e6bd735763f67f.poster.avif?t=1754316384\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3581890/extras/a66b19cd3ce784c1e9e6bd735763f67f.webm?t=1754316384\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Step into Catlands and let the purr-fect adventure begin! \ud83d\udc3e</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3581890/extras/fcf4c3d8b6e4565c77ae5953d8853110.avif?t=1754316384\" width=800 height=264 /></span></p>",
